ene was cut from  the show so in the end it's as if Derek  chose to withhold this information  because he was afraid that Meredith  wouldn't take him back as it turned out  no one is perfect  McDreamy included here are the things we  love everything from Disney movies like  frozen to dramatic TV like Grey's  Anatomy if you'd like to stay up to date  with the latest TV trends subscribe to  the things and click that Bell to be  notified whenever we post a new video if  you're watching on your phone go into  YouTube settings and turn on  notifications  April's morals go out the window when  April Kepner was first introduced in  season six she quickly gained a  reputation for being Little Miss Perfect  for a super long time April kept her  relationship with God top secret because  she didn't want the other doctors to  judge her she was a devout Christian who  was saving herself for marriage and her  morals were the utmost importance to her  now it's only normal for characters to  have arcs so we were expecting his shift  in April's personality but we never once  thought it would happen so quickly the  night before the residents had their  medical boards April chose to throw her  morals out the window she slept with  Jackson out of the blue which seriously  messed with her head we were all for the  April Jackson's storyline but a lot of  fans think that April's character change  was much too drastic and super  unrealistic my God my God why have you  forsaken me  the custody battle once upon a time in  Seattle Callie and Arizona were one of  the cutest couples in town but things  started to get a little messy when  Callie had a fling with Mark and ended  up pregnant  Callie Arizona and Mark agreed to be  co-parent and things were going smoothly  for quite some time that is until mark  passed away in a plane crash that would  also leave Polly with an amputated leg  these life-altering events would lead to  Callie and Arizona's divorce and soon  Callie would start dating penny and  dream of moving to New York with her new  girlfriend and daughter Sofia problem  was Sophia was Arizona's daughter too  and she wasn't about to let her go  without a fight  there is a messy custody battle and  Callie was eventually granted sole  custody are we the only ones who think  this storyline was super inconsistent we  mean Sophia had just lost her father and  Callie was ready to move to New York  leaving her daughter's second mother  behind to make matters worse poor Sophia  had to go through a stressful custody  battle only to end up moving away with  Callie and penny anyway no matter what  the judge decides Derek's demise it was  no secret that actor Patrick Dempsey who  portrayed Derek Shepherd wanted out of  Grey's Anatomy but after being a prime  member of the cast for a total of 11  seasons getting rid of him wouldn't be  easy in season 11 episode 21 Derek's  life met an abrupt end when he came  face-to-face with a semi-truck fans  weren't too happy about the way Derek  left the show especially since his  demise would be viewed as a major  pothole while on his way to quit the  president's brain mapping project in  Washington Derek came across an accident  and pulled over to help he saved a young  girl and her mother as well as another  couple but before Derek could get back  into his car and drive away he was hit  by an oncoming truck so here's the plot  hole why didn't dare eat check before  crossing the road and why didn't he hear  the truck coming it's not like he was in  a crowded place with lots of noise  quite the contrary really he should have  heard that truck coming from a mile away  what happened to Addison when we first  met Addison Montgomery and season 1 of  Grey's Anatomy  we immediately don't like her after all  she did cheat on McDreamy Meredith and  Addison bumped heads for quite some time  before burying the hatchet  Addison eventually left the show when  her character was given her very own  spinoff series if I hadn't been here  today if you'd had someone else that  girl would have died delivering her baby  but if there's one thing that's bugs  fans ever since Derek's demise it's how  Addison never made an appearance at her  ex-husband's funeral we get it she's  busy and all but she's not heartless so  why didn't she show Izzy's medical bills  as he might have made some bad decisions  in the past but we never viewed her as a  bad person but that all changed when she  was fired from the grey Sloan Memorial  Hospital convinced that Alex got her  fired  he left her husband without ever giving  him an explanation what's worse is that  she stuck him with her medical bills and  let's just say that cancer treatment  isn't cheap for an entire episode Alex  was super stressed out over all the  money he owed but whether he paid her  medical bills or not was never revealed  this season six plot hole still bugs us  until this very day we all know why  Katherine Heigl's character was given a  bad rap on the show after all  Katherine's seriously messed up when she  withdrew herself from the 2008 Emmy race  stating that the material didn't warrant  an Emmy nomination and I'm not going to  apologize for that  I'm not a rude person I'm not an unkind  or mean person Shonda Rhimes fired back  by giving Izzie the worst character arc  of all time  but even then fans want to know what  happened to the Izzie stifling medical  debt and that's it for the 10 major plot  holes in Grey's Anatomy we hope you  liked our video before you go tell us  who your favorite character is and why  sound off in the comments  thanks for watching don't forget to give  this video a big thumbs up we'll see you  next time on the things

